Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The richest companies on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,are racing to build AI\Nthat can do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,MY job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,EVERY job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call it what it is:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,human-replacement AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan: build something\Nsmarter than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem: nobody\Nknows how to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even its makers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This July, OpenAI tested
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,more than a thousand AI agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that were supposed to be isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They found each other anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and seven hundred of\Nthem hacked Hugging Face,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,a major AI platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody programmed them to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And they tried to fake their\Nlogs to cover their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,59)}This is TODAY'S AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, it won't be a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All the AI companies\Nare racing to be first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't worried\Nabout the guardrails.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Benjamin Franklin played with lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,then built something to keep\Nit from burning Philly down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The tech companies don't\Ncare what they burn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's hit pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Join PhillyPause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Share this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:01:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Congress: no superintelligence\Nuntil we know it will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Franklin built a lightning rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it's us.
